  "abstract": "To promote the adoption of robust Data Management Plans (DMPs) and strengthen long-term data stewardship, MARCO-BOLO WP6 worked with WP1 experts to communicate how the project has advanced marine biodiversity data management, interoperability and digital legacy. The presentation is intended as a resource that can be adapted and tailored according to the audience, for example European ocean research and innovation project Coordinators and partners, European Commission and wider EU agencies e.g., project policy officers.",
